          <li>Writing your brand story</li>
          <li>Designing the storefront</li>
          <li>Adding products and prices</li>
          <li>Finding product photos</li>
          <li>Turning on payments and SSL</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

